<title>USA: Wolverine Tube names Quarles interim CEO.</title>
<headline>Wolverine Tube names Quarles interim CEO.</headline>
<dateline>HUNTSVILLE, Ala. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wolverine Tube Inc said on Monday it named John Quarles interim chief executive, and began a search for a permanent replacement for the former CEO, Thomas Roller, who has left the company.</p>
<p>Quarles, the company's chairman, was its chief executive from 1990 to 1996.</p>
<p>Wolverine Tube makes copper and copper-alloy tube. Its shares were trading down 1/2 to 26-1/2 early Monday. Their 52-week high was 43-1/4.</p>
